OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity asks alumni for dental
OL,4,Aschool support
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe University of East Anglia is asking
OL,7,Fformer students for financial help to
OL,8,Fequip its new dental school.
OL,10,FIn an email to alumni, the head of the
OL,11,FFaculty of Medicine has asked them to
OL,12,Fconsider donating #10 a month, adding:
OL,13,F"Your support could help equip the
OL,14,Fclinical spaces where students learn,
OL,15,Fprovide specialist instruments and
OL,16,Fstate-of-the-art training equipment."
OL,18,FThe UEA says there is no funding crisis
OL,19,Fand the school will open next year, but
OL,20,Fadmits its business model has become
OL,21,F"tougher" because it was only allocated
OL,22,F25 student places.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
